{"strongs": "H0117", "word": "אַדִּיר", "translit": "ad.dir", "root": "אדיר", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "majestic", "definition": "אַדִּיר adjective majestic — ׳ א Ps 8:2 +; feminine אַדֶּ֫רֶת Ezek 17:8 ? (see below) etc. — 1. majestic (wide, lofty) of waters of sea Exod 15:10 ; Ps 93:4 a ship Isa 33:21 a tree Ezek 17:23 a vine Ezek 17:8 ( גֶּפֶן אַדֶּרֶת , so Fü ; or ׳ א abstract noun see below אַדֶּרֶת below); also figurative of kings Ps 136:18 nations Ezek 32:18 gods 1Sam 4:8 of ׳ י Ps 93:4 ; Ps 76:5 of name of ׳ י Ps 8:2 ; Ps 8:10 . 2. substantive majestic one , of nobles, chieftains, etc., Judg 5:13 ; Judg 5:25 ; Nah 2:6 ; Nah 3:18 Jer 14:3 ; Jer 25:34 ( אַדִּירֵי הַצּאֹן figurative so): Jer 25:35 ; Jer 25:36 ; Jer 30:21 ; Zech 11:2 ; 2Chr 23:20 ; Neh 3:5 ; Neh 10:30 of ׳ י Isa 10:34 ; Isa 33:21 of servants of ׳ י Ps 16:3 (= priests ? compare 1Chr 24:5 & see Che ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB138')\">BDB138</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H117')\">H117</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB137')\">BDB137</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB139')\">BDB139</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַדִּיר</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>majestic</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,2)\">Ps 8:2</ref> +; <b>feminine</b> <bdbheb>אַדֶּ֫רֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,8)\">Ezek 17:8</ref> ? (see below) etc. — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> majestic (wide, lofty) of waters of sea <ref ref=\"Exod 15:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,10)\">Exod 15:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 93:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,4)\">Ps 93:4</ref> a ship <ref ref=\"Isa 33:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,21)\">Isa 33:21</ref> a tree <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,23)\">Ezek 17:23</ref> a vine <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,8)\">Ezek 17:8</ref> (<bdbheb>גֶּפֶן אַדֶּרֶת</bdbheb>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Fü')\">Fü</lookup>; or <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> abstract noun see below <bdbheb>אַדֶּרֶת</bdbheb> below); also figurative of kings <ref ref=\"Ps 136:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"136\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"136\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,136,18)\">Ps 136:18</ref> nations <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,18)\">Ezek 32:18</ref> gods <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,8)\">1Sam 4:8</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 93:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"93\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"93\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,93,4)\">Ps 93:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 76:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"76\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"76\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,76,5)\">Ps 76:5</ref> of name of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,2)\">Ps 8:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 8:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,10)\">Ps 8:10</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> substantive <highlight>majestic one</highlight>, of nobles, chieftains, etc., <ref ref=\"Judg 5:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,13)\">Judg 5:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 5:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,25)\">Judg 5:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Nah 2:6\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,6)\">Nah 2:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Nah 3:18\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"3\" vBe